---@param endX number # MISSING_PARAM_DESC
---@param endY number # MISSING_PARAM_DESC
---@param endZ number # MISSING_PARAM_DESC
---@return any value # Returns true and the position of the intersection point of the line and the water surface if there is a collision, or false if there is no collision.
function testLineAgainstWater(...) end

